OL,3,ATrump pledges $5,000 to every American
OL,4,A- and other takeaways from Republican
OL,5,Amidterms convention
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Republican Party's first midterms
OL,8,Fconvention had all the trappings of the
OL,9,Ftraditional presidential election-year
OL,10,Fgathering: supporters in sparkling
OL,11,Fcostumes, a conveyor belt of candidate
OL,12,Fspeeches, and vendors selling campaign
OL,13,Fmerchandise.
OL,15,FBut unlike an ordinary convention, no
OL,16,Fofficial party business was conducted
OL,17,Fin Dallas, with the event instead
OL,18,Fserving as a rally for Republicans who
OL,19,Fare seeking to boost turnout and avoid
OL,20,Flosing control of Congress in November.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
