OL,3,AFive dead and 86 missing as
OL,4,A'heartbreaking' fire breaks out on
OL,5,APhilippines ferry
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least five people have died and 86
OL,8,Fare missing after a fire broke out on a
OL,9,Fferry in the Philippines, the country's
OL,10,Fcoastguard said.
OL,12,FThe MV June Aster, which set off from
OL,13,Fthe capital Manila ferrying 117
OL,14,Fpassengers and 17 crew members, was
OL,15,Fnearing its destination at the tourist
OL,16,Fhotspot of Coron in the province of
OL,17,FPalawan when it caught fire.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11912
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1789021081
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFive dead and 86 missing as
OL,4,A'heartbreaking' fire breaks out on
OL,5,APhilippines ferry
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe blaze, which erupted at 18:00 local
OL,8,Ftime (10:00 GMT) Wednesday, was still
OL,9,Fburning as of 11:00 on Thursday. The
OL,10,Fstrong currents and poor weather were a
OL,11,Fchallenge to those working to
OL,12,Fextinguish it, the coastguard said.
OL,14,FA first responder told the BBC they had
OL,15,Fnever seen such a disaster in Coron,
OL,16,Fcalling it "really heartbreaking".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
