OL,3,ASpanish intelligence warned of Ceuta
OL,4,Amass crossing plans before surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Pedro Sanchez has
OL,7,Finsisted that the events of 30 July
OL,8,Fwere impossible to predict, but
OL,9,Fopposition parties say the documents
OL,10,Fshow the government misled Spaniards.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
